## 13. PILLAR: 100% MOBILE DOM DISCIPLINE (NEW)
- **Sub-Pillar A (Viewport Lockdown):** Enforce `overflow-x-clip` on the root layout to completely eradicate horizontal scroll jitter on mobile devices.
